634	-- set. A pool is a member of at most one pool, never of itself through any chain, and a chain of pools is at most
635	-- three deep (the app refuses each with a message). A member pool has no pot of its own: its pot is its cut in the
636	-- pool above.
637	ALTER TABLE pool_member ALTER COLUMN person_id SET NULL;
